  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Mutant_Wolf/BH_MW_HEADER.png\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Mutant_Wolf/BH_MW_ABOUT.png\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">遊戲中新增了一款名為「變異狼」的迷你 Boss，&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">變異狼是一隻速度極快的惡魔&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">它擁有 150 HP（75 顆心），比傀儡多 50 點，&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">變異狼每次攻擊造成 10 點傷害</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">擊敗後會掉落骨頭與黃金</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">擊殺後有稀有機率獲得變異狼盔甲</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">變異狼盔甲在各方面皆優於下界合金</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"> 防禦力 +1、護甲韌性 +1 與擊退抗性 +1</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:36px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Mutant_Wolf/BH_MW_FEATURES.png\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">召喚變異狼非常簡單</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">你必須手持骨頭並擊殺一隻狼</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">骨頭會被消耗，狼隨即出現</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">狼會被彈射至空中，讓你有些時間準備</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Mutant_Wolf/BH_MW_SHOWCASE.png\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/sZP2b-fIKTk?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><span style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Mutant_Wolf/BH_MW_PROMO.png\"></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">點擊上方圖片，選擇方案（建議至少 4GB），使用我的優惠碼 <strong>Cursed</strong>&nbsp;即可享有首月 <strong>25%</strong>&nbsp;折扣，並與朋友們盡情遊玩！&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/ZUah6a8Dqf\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Mutant_Wolf/BH_MW_DISCORD.png\"></a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>",
